             - lammpsbondfile: LAMMPS bond files, see http://lammps.sandia.gov/doc/fix_reax_bonds.html
             - lammpsdumpfile: LAMMPS dump files, see https://lammps.sandia.gov/doc/dump.html
             - xyz: xyz files
